  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CIPESA: ICT for Democracy in East Africa.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">CIPESA: ICT f&#xf6;r demokrati i &#xd6;st Afrika</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">CIPESA (Collaboration on International ICT Policy in East and         Southern Africa)arbetar regionalt i &#xf6;stra respektive s&#xf6;dra Afrika och har sin bas i Kampala, Uganda. CIPESA&apos;s huvudsakliga verksamheten &#xe4;r  forskning kring ICT i regionen. Syftet med insatsen &#xe4;r att fr&#xe4;mja en  effektiv representation av afrikanska intressen i utformningen av     politik som r&#xf6;r ICT fr&#xe5;gor.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The CIPESA project &quot;ICT for Democracy in East Africa: Promoting Open  Government, Human Rights, Right to information and Civic Agency&quot; aims to leverage Information and Communications Technology (ICT) to turn   East Africans, including detached communities such as women, the      rural poor and youth, into active citizens that engage with other     citizens and with leaders, and play a role in local decision-making.</narrative>
  </description>
